oward victory or will they be cursed with defeat?<br>\n<br>\n(Source: Aniplex of America)<br>\n<br>\n<i>Notes:<br>\n- Includes Prologue.<br>\n- The first, second and last episodes aired with a runtime of ~48 minutes as opposed to the standard 24 minute long episode.<br>\n- Based on the second route from TYPE-MOON's visual novel, Fate/stay night.\n</i>","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":28,"month":12,"year":2014},"episodes":13,"externalLinks":[{"language":"Japanese","site":"Official Site","type":"INFO","url":"http://www.fate-sn.com/ubw/"},{"language":null,"site":"Crunchyroll","type":"STREAMING","url":"https://www.crunchyroll.com/series/GY8V11X7Y/fatestay-night-unlimited-blade-works"},{"language":null,"site":"Netflix","type":"STREAMING","url":"http://www.netflix.com/title/80040330"},{"language":null,"site":"Hulu","type":"STREAMING","url":"http://www.hulu.com/fatestay-night-unlimited-blade-works"},{"language":"Japanese","site":"Twitter","type":"SOCIAL","url":"https://twitter.com/Fate_SN_Anime"}],"genres":["Action","Fantasy","Supernatural"],"hashtag":"#fate_sn_anime","isLicensed":true,"meanScore":80,"nextAiringEpisode":null,"rankings":[{"allTime":true,"context":"highest rated all time","format":"TV","rank":324,"season":null,"type":"RATED","year":null},{"allTime":true,"context":"most popular all time","format":"TV","rank":174,"season":null,"type":"POPULAR","year":null},{"allTime":false,"context":"highest rated","format":"TV","rank":12,"season":null,"type":"RATED","year":2014},{"allTime":false,"context":"most popular","format":"TV","rank":13,"season":null,"type":"POPULAR","year":2014},{"allTime":false,"context":"highest rated","format":"TV","rank":5,"season":"FALL","type":"RATED","year":2014},{"allTime":false,"context":"most popular","format":"TV","rank":4,"season":"FALL","type":"POPULAR","year":2014}],"relations":[["ALTERNATIVE",356,356,"ANIME","TV"],["PREQUEL",11741,11741,"ANIME","TV"],["SEQUEL",20792,28701,"ANIME","TV"],["SPIN_OFF",14829,14829,"ANIME","ONA"],["ALTERNATIVE